  "Wikipedia district pages (all 36; raw wikitext read 2026-10-06) for cross-checking each district's assembly segments where the page lists them (fully matched: Ahilyanagar, Chhatrapati Sambhajinagar, Gadchiroli, Jalgaon, Jalna, Nagpur, Palghar, Parbhani, Ratnagiri, Wardha, Washim, Yavatmal, Beed, Bhandara, Chandrapur, Dharashiv, Hingoli, Latur, Raigad, Satara, Sindhudurg); no district page places a seat in a different district except in Lok Sabha listings",
