  "https://www.thehindu.com/news/national/other-states/maharashtras-ahmednagar-to-be-officially-called-ahilyanagar/article67947010.ece (13 Mar 2024: state cabinet approves Ahmednagar -> Ahilyanagar; cited by the Wikipedia Ahmednagar district page, which gives the official name as Ahilyanagar district)",
